{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashes of Mankind: Citadels is an immersive, tactical FPS set in a dystopian future. Players embody Revenants, elite, genetically enhanced warriors, navigating a world torn by endless wars.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/5f6b1589600a0b2df699cca034a1c4b9.poster.avif?t=1774969232\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/5f6b1589600a0b2df699cca034a1c4b9.webm?t=1774969232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/5f6b1589600a0b2df699cca034a1c4b9.mp4?t=1774969232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set against the backdrop of the Citadel and the rugged landscapes of Ortus, the game challenges players to confront moral choices and survive relentless battles. Created by Black Ice Studios, a team of gamers, ex-military, and industry veterans based in Canada, this game combines hardcore realism with lore-rich storytelling to deliver an experience that almost feels like a survival simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/34185d64c3a7ad8ba7e4f1d170266fe4.poster.avif?t=1774969232\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/34185d64c3a7ad8ba7e4f1d170266fe4.webm?t=1774969232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/34185d64c3a7ad8ba7e4f1d170266fe4.mp4?t=1774969232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashes of Mankind delivers intense, tactical FPS gameplay built by gamers, for gamers. Featuring a mix of extraction-based gameplay, first-person immersion, and unforgiving realism, this game emphasizes skill and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/8685cb5f2608bb52a8268d2e6c32f4e1.poster.avif?t=1774969232\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/8685cb5f2608bb52a8268d2e6c32f4e1.webm?t=1774969232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/8685cb5f2608bb52a8268d2e6c32f4e1.mp4?t=1774969232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/714680?t=1774969232","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774969232","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/ca8b635593f5d34c1835e1363690966bdfe42253/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774969232","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/ca8b635593f5d34c1835e1363690966bdfe42253/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774969232","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Playe